===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|grammar|of a [[word]], [[phrase]], or especially an [[adjective]]}} Possessing the property it describes.
#: {{ux|en|The word ''polysyllabic'' is '''autological''', but the word ''monosyllabic'' is not.}}
#: {{ux|en|Because the word ''short'' is in fact short, it is considered '''autological'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|The word ''noun'' is itself a noun, and is thus '''autological'''.}}

